# Judge2-8-5

@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@pauseTrial false { timer:false }
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
